    "body": "Previously, Shadow.PointerType performed a deferred import of the `Shadow.cast` function in `__init__` and `__setitem__`.\r\n\r\nThe `cast` function is defined at the module level and there are no conflicts with another `cast` function (like `typing.cast`) that would require shadowing the function.\r\n\r\nThe imports also prevented users from copying the Shadow module [0] out with a different name.\r\n\r\n[0]: https://cython.readthedocs.io/en/latest/src/tutorial/pure.html#magic-attributes",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-22T11:40:52Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cython/cython/issues/7999/comments",
