                "comment_count": 0,
                "committer": {
                    "date": "2026-09-18T11:48:56Z",
                    "email": "vfazio@gmail.com",
                    "name": "Vincent Fazio"
                },
                "message": "Remove deferred imports from Shadow.PointerType\n\nPreviously, Shadow.PointerType performed a deferred import of the\n`Shadow.cast` function in `__init__` and `__setitem__`.\n\nThe `cast` function is defined at the module level and there are no\nconflicts with another `cast` function (like `typing.cast`) that would\nrequire shadowing the function.\n\nThe imports also prevented users from copying the Shadow module [0] out\nwith a different name.\n\n[0]: https://cython.readthedocs.io/en/latest/src/tutorial/pure.html#magic-attributes\n\nSigned-off-by: Vincent Fazio <vfazio@gmail.com>",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "998f33e49513b8b87d1c5991b73c2dd802edb464",
